  "instructions": [
    "In a blender, combine coconut milk, bicol express paste, salt, black pepper, and blend until smooth.",
    "Heat the blended mixture in a saucepan over medium heat, stirring constantly, until it thickens.",
    "Add the chopped ferment-kimchi, sliced green chili, and minced garlic to the saucepan and stir well.",
    "Add the diced avocado to the saucepan and stir gently to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the avocado is heated through.",
    "Stir in the chopped onion and lemon juice.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a copper mug.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional sliced green chili if desired."
  ],
